<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const propertyAddressUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = propertyAddressUser.fullName || 'Landlord'; %>
    <%- include('../../partials/sidebar-landlord') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Landlord workspace</p>
        <p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/user-profile" aria-label="Landlord profile" title="Landlord profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <a class="mb-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/user/landlord/properties"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Back to Properties</a>
          <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Property setup</p>
          <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Add property</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Property creation can begin only when private draft storage and a resumable, validated setup workflow are connected.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="property-draft-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">add_home_work</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Draft status</p>
                <h2 id="property-draft-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Property drafts are not connected</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No PropertyDraft model, save endpoint, validation contract, ownership policy, resume state, or publishing lifecycle exists. Address fields are hidden to prevent silent data loss.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 property drafts</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center sm:px-8" aria-labelledby="address-step-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">location_off</span>
              <p class="mt-4 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Planned step 1 of 5</p>
              <h2 id="address-step-title" class="mt-2 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Address and property type are unavailable</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Do not enter a property name, full address, postcode, type, occupancy, or furnishing details until the application can save them privately and recover failed submissions.</p>
              <a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/landlord/properties"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">home_work</span>Return to properties</a>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="property-draft-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="property-draft-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required draft foundations</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">The first step needs durable ownership and privacy before collecting a real address.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">database</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Private draft record</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Create a landlord-owned draft with immutable ID, created/updated timestamps, versioning, and tenant-scoped authorization.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">rule</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Validated property identity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Define supported countries, address schema, postcode rules, property types, residential fields, limits, and field-level errors.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">privacy_tip</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Address privacy</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Separate private full address and access rules from any approximate location intentionally displayed in a published listing.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">save</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Save and resume</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Support partial saves, validation errors, duplicate handling, retries, stale-version conflicts, and safe continuation to the next step.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="planned-property-steps-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="planned-property-steps-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Planned setup sequence</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Every later step depends on the same saved draft identifier.</p>
              </div>
              <ol class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">1</span><div><h3 class="font-bold text-on-surface">Address and property type</h3><p class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Private identity, location, property category, and core residential details.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high font-bold text-on-surface">2</span><div><h3 class="font-bold text-on-surface">Listing details</h3><p class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Public description, amenities, policies, and structured listing content.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high font-bold text-on-surface">3</span><div><h3 class="font-bold text-on-surface">Rent and availability</h3><p class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Pricing, deposit, bills, tenancy terms, and authoritative availability.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high font-bold text-on-surface">4</span><div><h3 class="font-bold text-on-surface">Photos and documents</h3><p class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Validated media plus private compliance-document storage and access.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high font-bold text-on-surface">5</span><div><h3 class="font-bold text-on-surface">Review and publish</h3><p class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Completeness, previews, confirmations, moderation, and publish history.</p></div></li>
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Property draft boundaries">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="draft-actions-title">
              <h2 id="draft-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Action availability</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Enter address details</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Save draft</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Resume draft</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Continue to step 2</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="address-safety-title">
              <h2 id="address-safety-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Keep addresses private</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">Do not send a full property address, ownership file, access code, tenant detail, or compliance document through Contact or Messages.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="property-context-title">
              <h2 id="property-context-title" class="font-bold text-on-surface">Portfolio context is not a listing</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">The property count saved during onboarding is a self-reported estimate. It does not create property records or publish listings.</p>
              <a class="mt-3 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/onboarding-landlord"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">domain</span>Review onboarding</a>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
